What you can expect with us:

Together with a great team of offensive professionals, you will have the opportunity to develop and expand your knowledge and expertise in cybersecurity.

We have offices in the two main technology centers of the Netherlands: Eindhoven and Amsterdam. This role can be filled from either location.

Growth opportunities: We are a fast growing company and you will have the opportunity to grow in this. Whether it involves responsibilities, increasing your visibility within and outside the organization, or attending training and education, at Bureau Veritas Cybersecurity your career development is key.

Cool projects: You will work with a wide range of renowned clients and customers. This gives you the opportunity to demonstrate your expertise and apply your skills in different environments, allowing you to continue to grow and learn. We do not only offer opportunities for projects within the Netherlands. There will also be opportunities internationally.

Culture: At Bureau Veritas Cybersecurity, we value celebrating successes and creating an enjoyable work environment. We regularly organize fun activities ranging from annual ski trips to various wine and beer tastings, sailing trips, barbecues and more. Here, team building is key.

We offer:

- Compensation: a gross salary between €4.400,- and €6.700,- per month based on fulltime employment and depending on your skills, educational background and work experience
- Connectivity allowance: a fixed net allowance of €100,- per month (based on a 40-hour workweek) for internet and telephone.
- Employee vitality: we realise that exercise boosts health, mood, and concentration so we support it with a €30 contribution out of your gross monthly salary (tax efficient!) with choices of sports subscriptions via Bedrijfsfitness NL.
- Holidays: 28 days (based on a 40-hour work week) and the option to buy 10 extra holidays.
- Hybrid working: remote working and working abroad policy. You can work from another country for a maximum of 2 months per calendar year.
- Mobility: our mobility policy offers flexible options designed to make commuting and business travel efficient, fair, and cost-conscious. Depending on your position there are three regulations for traveling: the Mobility Standard Regulation, the Mobility Plus Regulation and, in exceptional cases, the Lease Car Regulation.
- Pension: each month, the employee and BV Cyber commit respectively 5% and 6% of the pensionable salary individually, totalling 11%, to be invested in a life cycle fund. In addition to the standard contributions made by BV Cyber and the employee, there is also flexibility to opt for voluntary additional contributions on a monthly or yearly basis.
- Performance bonus: this a reflection of the individual achievements and performance and the profit of the company throughout the previous year. The bonus can amount to a month's salary.
- Wellbeing: our policy is built on three core pillars: prevention, early identification, and meaningful support. We're committed to creating a workplace where you can thrive both professionally and personally. We offer the OpenUp platform services for employees and family members including the Financial Wellbeing module.

